  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PA Centre of Excellence for Maintenance and Repair of Agro-processing Machinery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishment of a Centre of Excellence for Maintenance and Repair of Agro-processing Equipment in Kenya. The purpose of this project is to build Kenya#s capacity to train highly skilled technicians able to maintain and repair agro-processing machinery and thus contribute to a competitive agro-processing sector.</narrative>
  </description>
